    "3. Search this table for next link candidate B that accepts A output as input",
    "4. Direct worker model to execute verification for candidate B",
    "5. If B confirmed, elevate combined severity to High/Critical and calculate terminal impact",
    "6. Document the multi-hop attack chain narrative for executive reporting"
